@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@projectId = notebooks-etl
@workflowId = material.master_refresh
@taskId = ods_etl.upsert_ods_material_from_delta
@instanceId = 82

### 任务完整自描述契约
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scheduler/tasks/{{taskId}}/contract

### 单任务声明血缘
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scheduler/tasks/{{taskId}}/lineage

### 全局声明血缘
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scheduler/lineage

### 上传文件（把路径改为本机真实文件）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/etl/artifacts
X-Requested-By: hutie
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ETLBoundary

--ETLBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="material.parquet"
Content-Type: application/x-parquet

< C:/data/material.parquet
--ETLBoundary--

### 使用受控 artifactId 启动物料主数据刷新
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/material-master/refresh
X-Requested-By: hutie
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "artifactId": "art_replace_me",
  "planId": "plan-2026-07",
  "versionId": "v1",
  "reason": "REST Client closed-loop acceptance"
}

### 查询状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scheduler/projects/{{projectId}}/runs/{{instanceId}}/status

### 查询 Node 实例
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scheduler/projects/{{projectId}}/runs/{{instanceId}}/tasks

### 查询第一个 Node 日志
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scheduler/projects/{{projectId}}/runs/{{instanceId}}/log?skipLineNum=0&limit=20000

### 显式停止
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/scheduler/projects/{{projectId}}/runs/{{instanceId}}/stop

### TaskGroup 队列快照
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/scheduler/projects/{{projectId}}/task-groups/ducklake-writers/queue?pageNo=1&pageSize=20
